Description: Free public beta demo — not yet device-tested. HCG Halo draws an animated neon light border around the Home Screen edges: Static, Breathing, Colour Flow, Orbit and Sci-Fi Circuit modes, custom colours and gradients, presets and an iPhone 11 Pro Max device profile. Off after installation; enable it in Settings.
